<sect1 id="compare_floats_8h_1motivation">
<title>Motivation</title><para>Equal to <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_point_source__rhsop" kindref="compound">PointSource_rhsop</ref>, but can be applied as <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_c_v_f_e_m___visitor" kindref="compound">CVFEM_Visitor</ref>.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_upwind_control_visitor_1usage">
